description:
Software Developer
Job Responsibilities:
Develop, create and modify general computer applications software or specialized utility sample programs;
Analyze use cases and propose system design and feasible software solutions or suggestions for customers within time and cost constraints;
Create and implement product test guidelines; Test various Orbbec product SDKs and finalize the official release process; Use scientific analysis and mathematical method to measure the outcome and consequences of data;
Modify and maintain existing SDKs to correct errors, upgrade interface, and improve performance;
Evaluate SDK development methodology in an agile environment and provide maintenance, enhancements and support on Linux system, ROS, Unity and mobile platforms;
Analyze business and application requirements and collaborate with R&D team to develop and customized solutions for business development; and
Provide technical support and troubleshooting services for customer. Test and identify issues addressed by customers and developers. Propose efficient solutions to meet customer’s specific requirements or issues.
Job requirements:
Must have a master degree in computer engineering or a related field. Must have taken graduate courses: Introduction to Programming Systems Design; Web Technologies; Introduction to Computer Network; Foundations of Artificial Intelligence; Operating Systems and Advanced Mobile Devices and Game Console.
Please send resumes to Qing Li, Orbbec 3D Technology International, Inc., 2800 Livernois Rd. Suite 220, Troy, MI, 48083.
